{
  "_comment": [
    "Traffic light + capture of EVERY plausibly relevant hook event.",
    "",
    "Install: cp tools/hook-settings.debug.json .claude/settings.json",
    "         then restart Claude Code.",
    "",
    "Purpose: find out whether ANY hook fires at the moment you answer a",
    "permission prompt. Today WAITING is only cleared by PostToolUse, which",
    "fires when the approved command finishes rather than when you approve",
    "it, so the light stays red for the whole command. If nothing fires at",
    "answer time, that is a hard limit of the hook surface and worth knowing",
    "for certain rather than assuming.",
    "",
    "Deliberately excluded as high-volume and irrelevant: FileChanged,",
    "CwdChanged, DirectoryAdded, ConfigChange, WorktreeCreate/Remove,",
    "InstructionsLoaded, Setup, TeammateIdle."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/Downloads/Projects/traffic-lights/tools/capture/capture-hook.sh",
            "args": [
              "PreToolUse"
            ],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/bin/traffic-light-hook",
            "args": [
              "-hook",
